    {
      "displayText": "“Freezing moves are powerful. Your Pokémon will\nbe at my mercy when they are frozen solid.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“That’s because frozen Pokémon can’t do a thing\nin battle”...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C00540068006100742019007300200062006500630061007500730065002000660072006F007A0065006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000630061006E2019007400200064006F002000610020007400680069006E0067000A0069006E00200062006100740074006C0065201D002E002E002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahem. Could you tell I was doing an impression\nof my favorite Trainer?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nShe uses Ice-type Pokémon, so I do too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How about it, then?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWant to have a chilling battle against my\nIce types?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If being chilled to the bone sounds like your\nthing, let me know!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900660020006200650069006E00670020006300680069006C006C0065006400200074006F002000740068006500200062006F006E006500200073006F0075006E006400730020006C0069006B006500200079006F00750072000A007400680069006E0067002C0020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you up for a battle against my Ice-type team?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200075007000200066006F00720020006100200062006100740074006C006500200061006700610069006E007300740020006D00790020004900630065002D00740079007000650020007400650061006D003F00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
