      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“You’re better than I thought!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“Go on ahead!”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C0059006F007520190072006500200062006500740074006500720020007400680061006E00200049002000740068006F0075006700680074002100100001BE01000A201C0047006F0020006F006E0020006100680065006100640021201D00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm... Maybe I’m going a bit overboard with the\nquotes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D002E002E002E0020004D0061007900620065002000492019006D00200067006F0069006E00670020006100200062006900740020006F0076006500720062006F006100720064002000770069007400680020007400680065000A00710075006F007400650073002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anyway, you’re real strong!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nA little tip from me—don’t worry too much if your\nPokémon get frozen. They’ll thaw on their own.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Or you can always use Flame Wheel, Steam\nEruption, or Flare Blitz to melt the ice if your<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nPokémon knows one of those moves!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y’know, it’s so strange and incredible that there’s\na place like this in Lumiose. It’s like an ice field!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
